{
  "_comment": [
    "The GPU work behind every reported evaluation, read by src/compute_accounting.py (FLAGS NS-04, NS-15).",
    "Each group lists shard-directory globs relative to the repo root; `_recomputed` copies (CPU rescoring)",
    "and smoke runs are excluded unless listed. One shard ran on one H100, so a shard's checkpoint",
    "`elapsed_sec` is its GPU wall time. `corpus` marks the groups that ran on the stale cluster corpus."
  ],
